1
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:05,370
Right-click an open trade to see everything you can do with it.

2
00:00:05,470 --> 00:00:09,030
Stop sets a stop loss, and Limit sets a take profit.

3
00:00:09,130 --> 00:00:12,690
Trailing Stop moves your stop along as the price moves your way.

4
00:00:12,790 --> 00:00:17,050
Bulk Operations closes many trades at once, like all profitable ones.

5
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:22,410
Close Position closes this trade. Hedge opens the opposite trade. The shortcut keys are shown on the right.

6
00:00:22,510 --> 00:00:26,070
Copy Trade ID copies its number, for example to send to support.

7
00:00:26,170 --> 00:00:30,430
Export to Excel saves the table, and Filters narrow down what it shows.

8
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:34,660
View on Chart shows the trade's chart.

9
00:00:34,760 --> 00:00:38,160
The chart shows this trade's instrument, with the trade drawn on it.

